00:34:26.500 --> 00:34:52.500
<v Amanda Marks>And we see the play. And we leave, and we walk back to his place. And then the sleaze factor of this 21-year-old who dated this 14-year-old starts to rear its head. What was this guy doing dating me when I was 14? That's not acceptable.
<v Amanda Marks>我们看了戏。然后离开，走回他的住处。然后那个曾经约会过14岁少女的21岁男人的猥琐就开始显露出来了。这个家伙在跟我交往时到底在干什么？这不被接受。

00:34:52.500 --> 00:35:07.820
<v Amanda Marks>The tip-offs, there were just so many little things. We go back to his apartment. His apartment was really this mess. Oh, it seemed like he was kind of a pot head. He was smoking out the whole time. He was growing weed on his balcony. He was constantly smoking out.
<v Amanda Marks>暗示，有很多小细节。我们回了他的公寓。他的公寓简直是个猪圈。噢，他好像是个大麻瘾君子。他一直在吸大麻。他在阳台上种大麻。他一直在抽。

00:35:07.820 --> 00:35:09.600
<v Ira Glass>Was he still an out-of-work actor?
<v Ira Glass>他还是一名失业演员吗？

